Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a selective median on the smallest stable pool (pool1) to see if a tighter pool improves performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the best pool (pool3) using inverse error weights to see if it beats the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["rf","CWT_rf","DWT_rf","FT_rf","DWT_catboost","ONLY_CWT_catboost"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over the best pool (pool4) to see if averaging beats the weighted inverse-error combo.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

