Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool4","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a DBA combination on the current best pool (pool4) to see if iterative refinement improves over the simple mean.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool4","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a robust median over the current best pool (pool4) to see if it improves on the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a robust median over pool3 to see if it beats the current mean pool4 baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test a DBA combination on the smallest pool (pool1) to see if iterative refinement helps with the strong trend.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean over the full pool to see if a broader, robust average improves on the current leader.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a DBA on pool2 to see if a different pool improves the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

